message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MALA: Multi-Agent Legacy Architecture"
abstract: >
  A framework for multi-agent AI integration in legacy industrial systems.
  MALA connects agentic AI to legacy software (terminal screens, CSV archives,
  scanned PDFs) without requiring API modernisation, using CMDP-based safety
  filtering, Recursive Context Enrichment, and Human-on-the-Loop escalation.
